'''Cursed Death's Heads''' behave the same as regular Death's Heads but have a purple aura around them. If Isaac enters the aura, he will be inflicted with the [[Status Effects#Effects|fear status effect]] for around two seconds. While feared, Isaac is unable to fire tears nor perform any other actions except moving for the duration of the effect.

